{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Frame 是一款讓 iPhone 用戶拍出真正 RAW 相片與底片質感的相機 App，適合喜歡保留感測器原始細節、追求專業控制及自然底片顆粒的攝影愛好者。原價 US $12.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-278.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>保留感測器原始細節</h2>\n<p>Frame 支援 48 MP ProRAW 及感測器 RAW，保留未經壓縮的原始資料，夜間燈光保持暖調，雜訊化成細緻顆粒。內置 WAVO 設計的 Vision Film、Soft Film 與 Mono Film 三款風格；另備手動 ISO、快門、白平衡與對焦，以及直方圖、斑馬紋、對焦峰值和水平儀。十個分頁的編輯器依桌面編輯順序套用變化，智能相簿搜尋在 iPhone 本機執行，毋須帳戶、沒有廣告及追蹤。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-58.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-59.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-60.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-61.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-62.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Frame: Pro Camera</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/frame-pro-camera/id6834287872\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at